# Project overview

Open-core **ItineraryEdge**: edge visa-style travel itinerary API + web UI on Cloudflare. **WIP — not production-ready.**

## Layout

| Path | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `apps/web` | Next.js App Router (Cloudflare Pages) |
| `workers/core` | Worker A — public HTTP API |
| `packages/shared` | Shared types, validators, display geo pricing |
| `migrations/` | D1 schema for `itineraryedge-global` |
| `docs/` | Architecture, self-host, security, AI playbook |
| `.cursor/skills/` | Project skills for local agent-driven work |

## Stack

- **pnpm** workspace (`pnpm-workspace.yaml`); Node 20+
- Cloudflare **Pages** + **Workers** + **D1**
- Private billing sidecar: [`itineraryedge-billing`](https://github.com/lazehang/itineraryedge-billing) (Worker B — not in this repo)

